WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.824
Welcome to Module 1 of the learning path,

2
00:00:02.824 --> 00:00:07.112
The Zero Trust Assessment as
Evidence: evidence, not a verdict.

3
00:00:07.112 --> 00:00:12.067
Microsoft's Zero Trust Assessment is a
PowerShell module that tests a tenant against

4
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:16.812
hundreds of configuration items drawn
from Microsoft's configuration guidance.

5
00:00:16.812 --> 00:00:20.124
It produces a reading of the
configuration on one day.

6
00:00:20.124 --> 00:00:23.813
In this module you'll learn what
that reading can and can't tell you.

7
00:00:23.813 --> 00:00:26.969
Then, on a fictional export,
you'll see why the tool's

8
00:00:26.969 --> 00:00:30.587
six statuses have to be sorted
before anyone counts them.

9
00:00:30.587 --> 00:00:35.837
The path follows the ten steps of the Zero
Trust Assessment implementation guide;

10
00:00:35.837 --> 00:00:39.840
this module covers Steps 1 and 6,
and takes about forty minutes.
